'''Othom''' (超町長, ''Chō Chōchō'') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Mooth]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]].

