==Trivia==
*"Othom" is an anagram of "[[Mooth]]".
*His Japanese name, Chō Chōchō (超町長), is a pun that doesn't translate well to English: it literally translates to "Super Mayor", but each syllable shares a pronunciation with 蝶 ''chō'' (butterfly), so when said out loud, it will merely sound like the Japanese word for butterfly being said three times.
**Othom's Japanese description also uses many words containing ''chō'', effectively repeating it for 12 times if his name is also factored in. Mr. Mayor (町長さん ''Chōchō-san'') transcends (超えつ ''chōetsu'') even the last mayor (町長 ''chōchō'') of the ancient Lepidoptera region, his super-long (超長くて ''chō nagakute'') speeches are super-annoying (超迷惑 ''chō meiwaku'') to everyone, and his morning assemblies (朝礼 ''chōrei'') last such a long time (長時間 ''chōjikan'') they continue well into the night.
*When Othom was first released, his [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] trait was not mentioned in his Enemy Guide entry. This was fixed in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].
*Lepidoptera is an order of insects that includes butterflies and moths.
*He is tied with [[Haniwanwan]] for the lowest curse duration of all enemies.
*The Othom that spawns after 10,000 seconds (300,000 frames) in [[Round 4 (Inflation: Uber Rare)|Round 4]] of the Inflation: Uber Rare [[Otherworld Colosseum]] has the record for longest spawn time in the game.

